  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Factorials 1 - Evaluating and simplifying</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) Evaluate \({@pn@}!\).</p>
<p>\({@pn@}! = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>(b) Simplify \(\dfrac{ {@pm+2@}!}{ {@pm@}!}\) and give your answer as a number.</p>
<p>Answer = [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>\({@pn@}! = {@pn@} \times ({@pn@}-1) \times \dots \times 1 = {@pF1@}\).</p>
<p>For part (b), expand the larger factorial only as far as the smaller one:</p>
<p>\(\dfrac{ {@pm+2@}!}{ {@pm@}!} = \dfrac{ {@pm+2@} \times {@pm+1@} \times {@pm@}!}{ {@pm@}!} = {@pm+2@} \times {@pm+1@} = {@ta2@}\)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
